(1486,3098,'An acute or chronic gingival infection characterized by redness and swelling, necrosis extending from the interdental papillae along the gingival margins, pain, hemorrhage, necrotic odor, and often a pseudomembrane. The condition may extend to the oral mucosa, tongue, palate, or pharynx.','en',2,'2026-06-24 10:48:25',NULL,NULL,'15356FFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFF'),
